      "1≤Q≤2⋅1051 \\le Q \\le 2 \\cdot 10^51≤Q≤2⋅105",
      "1≤Ai≤N1 \\le A_i \\le N1≤Ai​≤N",
      "Ai≠AjA_i \\ne A_jAi​=Aj​ for all 1≤i&lt;j≤N1 \\le i \\lt j \\le N1≤i&lt;j≤N",
      "1≤L≤R≤N1 \\le L \\le R \\le N1≤L≤R≤N",
      "1≤X≤(R−L+1)1 \\le X \\le (R - L + 1)1≤X≤(R−L+1)",
      "The sum of NNN and the sum of QQQ both do not exceed 2⋅1052 \\cdot 10^52⋅105."
